sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Agent as Agent - parent process
    participant Budget as ExecutionBudget
    participant Model as Model callable
    participant Policy as ToolPolicy - optional
    participant Approval as Approval callback
    participant Journal as PostgreSQL or MongoDB journal - optional
    participant Tool as Inline function or isolated worker
    participant Session as Session store - file or database, optional

    Caller->>Agent: run_result(task)
    Agent->>Budget: Create fresh counters and deadline
    opt Journal enabled
        Agent->>Journal: assert_ready()
        Journal-->>Agent: Ready or recovery/error stop before model work
    end
    Note over Agent,Session: Add task and save conversation only after recovery permits it
    loop Main step - until final answer or stop
        opt History needs compaction
            Agent->>Budget: Admit summary call against shared limits
            Agent->>Model: Summarize old history with no tools
            Model-->>Agent: Summary and optional usage
        end
        Agent->>Budget: Admit main model call
        Agent->>Model: System, history, allowed schemas, text callback
        Model-->>Agent: Normalized content, stop reason and optional usage
        Agent->>Budget: Record usage
        alt Response contains tool requests
            loop Requests in response order
                Agent->>Budget: Admit non-truncated attempt
                Note over Agent: Allowlist lookup, optional application admission, primitive validation
                opt Policy configured
                    Agent->>Policy: Read-only gate and detached argument predicate
                    Policy-->>Agent: Allow, deny or policy error
                end
                opt Validated, policy-permitted risky request
                    Agent->>Approval: Decide using arguments
                    Approval-->>Agent: Allow or deny
                end
                alt Permitted and budget still available
                    Agent->>Budget: Recheck cooperative limits
                    opt Journal enabled
                        Agent->>Journal: Commit started action before invocation
                    end
                    Agent->>Tool: Invoke once after start notification and limit recheck
                    Tool-->>Agent: Known result or timeout/uncertain outcome
                    opt Journal enabled
                        Agent->>Journal: Commit outcome
                    end
                else Denied, invalid or truncated
                    Note over Agent,Tool: Not-run error; no invocation or journal action
                end
                Note over Agent: Preserve each obtained result before finish notification
            end
            Agent->>Session: Save complete tool-result batch
        else No tool requests
            Agent->>Session: Save final response
        end
    end
    Note over Agent,Tool: A terminal batch stop pairs remaining calls as not run; no automatic retry
    opt Journal permits normal finalization
        Agent->>Journal: Close run after session persistence
    end
    Agent-->>Caller: Immutable RunResult
    Note over Caller,Agent: Events observe lifecycle synchronously; traces are separate from sessions/journal